{"id":"salvia","name":"Salvia","form":"capsule","status":"Documented","aliases":"","category":"Dissociative","summarySources":"TripSit","summary":"A plant which, when smoked, causes short but very intense psychedelic experience. It is considered physically safe, though users of high dosages often experience bizarre, other-worldly scenarios which may be confusing or terrifying. Caution is highly recommended.","doseMaxTick":100,"doseUnit":"mg","doseRows":[],"durationSources":"TripSit","durationRows":[{"roa":"Sublingual","onset":"10–20 min","comeup":"—","peak":"—","offset":"—","afterEffects":"15–20 min","total":"30–60 min"},{"roa":"Smoked","onset":"0–2 min","comeup":"—","peak":"—","offset":"—","afterEffects":"15–20 min","total":"5–30 min"},{"roa":"General","onset":"—","comeup":"—","peak":"—","offset":"—","afterEffects":"15–20 min","total":"—"}],"subjectiveEffects":[{"name":"Amnesia","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Amnesia"},{"name":"Anxiety","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Anxiety"},{"name":"Auditory distortion","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_distortion"},{"name":"Auditory hallucinations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_hallucinations"},{"name":"Changes in felt bodily form","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Changes_in_felt_bodily_form"},{"name":"Changes in gravity","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Changes_in_gravity"},{"name":"Cognitive dysphoria","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Cognitive_dysphoria"},{"name":"Depth perception distortions","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Depth_perception_distortions"},{"name":"Drifting","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Drifting"},{"name":"Environmental cubism","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Environmental_cubism"},{"name":"Feelings of impending doom","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Feelings_of_impending_doom"},{"name":"Information processing suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Information_processing_suppression"},{"name":"Internal hallucinations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Internal_hallucinations"},{"name":"Language suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Language_suppression"},{"name":"Laughter","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Laughter"},{"name":"Machinescapes","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Machinescapes"},{"name":"Memory suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Memory_suppression"},{"name":"Perspective distortions","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Perspective_distortions"},{"name":"Scenery slicing","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Scenery_slicing"},{"name":"Spontaneous tactile sensations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Spontaneous_tactile_sensations"},{"name":"Synaesthesia","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Synaesthesia"},{"name":"Thought deceleration","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_deceleration"},{"name":"Transformations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Transformations"},{"name":"Unity and interconnectedness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Unity_and_interconnectedness"},{"name":"Visual disconnection#Structures","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Visual_disconnection#Structures"},{"name":"Radical shift in perspective and perception"},{"name":"Creative dreamlike experience"},{"name":"Increase in sensual and aesthetic appreciation"},{"name":"Introspective insight"},{"name":"Powerful closed/open eye visuals"},{"name":"General change in consciousness"},{"name":"Dissociation"},{"name":"Panic"},{"name":"Perspiration"},{"name":"Inability to control muscles"}],"combinations":[],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/salvia"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/%E9%BC%A0%E5%B0%BE%E8%8D%89%E5%B1%9E"}],"pharmacology":{"text":"Salvinorin A is a potent κ-opioid receptor agonist. It does not have any effect on the 5-HT2A receptor, the receptor targeted by most psychedelic substances, nor does it act as an NMDA receptor antagonist as dissociatives do. The unique structure of salvinorin A lacks features commonly associated with opioid ligand binding such as a guaternary carbon atom linked to a tertiary amine group by two other carbon atoms.","source":"PsychonautWiki","page":"Salvinorin A","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Salvinorin_A#Pharmacology"},"uses":{"text":"Salvinorin A is currently being researched in relation to its properties as an anti-addiction drug, and several analogs with improved pharmacokinetic profiles have been shown to have anti-addictive effects as well.","source":"PsychonautWiki","page":"Salvinorin A","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Salvinorin_A#Research"},"zh":"鼠尾草屬","summaryZh":"鼠尾草屬是唇形科下最大的一個屬，包括大約1000種植物，廣泛分布在全球各地的溫帶和熱帶地區，既有草本也有灌木或亞灌木，大多數品種集中在亞洲。 其中有許多品種可以入藥或作為觀賞花卉。"}